# "Late Night Study" — Lo-Fi Hip Hop
bpm 78
swing 35
steps 32
reverb 0.35
delay 0.2

kick  "x.....x...x.....x.....x...x....."
snare "....x.......x.......x.......x..+"
hh    "x.xox.x.x.xox.x.x.xox.x.x.xox.x."
oh    "..........x...............x....."
rim   "......+.......+.......+.......+."

vol kick 0.85
vol snare 0.7
vol hh 0.5
vol rim 0.35
pan hh -0.2

note "C2 ~ ~ ~ Eb2 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ Ab1 ~ ~ ~ C2 ~ ~ ~ Eb2 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
